**\n\n2. **Logical Deduction:**\n   - If the Picuris Mountains were in Texas, the donated Harding Pegmatite Mine would contradict the statement that \"no Texas mountain ranges have donated mines.\"\n   - Therefore, the Picuris Mountains **cannot be in Texas** and must be in **New Mexico**.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Since Juan de Onate visited the Picuris Mountains (which are in New Mexico), he did **not** visit a mountain range in Texas. \n\n**Answer:** B) False.",
