e correct answer is A.</think>.\n\nThe context explicitly states that Heinrich Schmidt was a Nazi German politician and a member of the Nazi Reichstag. The question\'s statement claims, "No politicians are part of the Nazi Reichstag." Since Heinrich Schmidt serves as a direct counterexample (he is both a politician and a member of the Reichstag), the statement is **false**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
